{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13108190","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13108190","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1310819001:0":{"text":"미안해요... 발리카 씨, 그는 당신이 입은 갑옷과 비슷한 갑옷을 입고 있었으니 분명 당신의 전우였을 거예요.","source_cn":"对不起……瓦丽卡女士，他穿着和你很像的盔甲，肯定也是你...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x435CD2AA2387D179","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1310819002:0":{"text":"치피도 그러고 싶지 않았는데, 그가 갑자기 저희를 공격하는 바람에...","source_cn":"满满也不想这样的，可是他突然攻击我们……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x74AA946AB6B3DC04","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1310819003:1":{"text":"아니, 사과할 필요 없어. 이성을 잃은 살아있는 시체는 무고한 생명을 공격하게 돼. 나는 그들을 제지할 수도 없고, 모진 마음을 먹고 그들을 없앨 수도 없어.","source_cn":"不，不需要道歉。失去理智的活死人会攻击无辜生灵。我无法...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x59E03230136AD0EE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1310819004:0":{"text":"그것이야말로 그들에겐 진정한 해방일 거야.","source_cn":"这样对他们来说才是真正的解脱。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3A15651310724079","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1310819005:0":{"text":"어라, “여신께서 얀 카민스키를 보호하시리” ...이건 부적 같은데요?","source_cn":"咦，“女神保佑扬·卡明斯基”……这似乎是个护身符？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x671E4997D86D33FA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"picture:7::0":{"text":"낡은 부적","source_cn":"陈旧的护身符","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFA0BA026DB472993","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1310819006:1":{"text":"그에게서 떨어진 거예요. 이건 분명 아주 중요한 물건이겠죠?","source_cn":"这是从他身上掉下来的，这一定对他很重要！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x11A8A891A22EB412","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1310819007:1":{"text":"얀 카민스키... 기억나. 아직 20살도 채 되지 않은 열정적인 청년이었지. 전장으로 나갔을 때, 그는 결혼한 지 1년도 되지 않은 상황이었어.","source_cn":"扬·卡明斯基……我记得他，一个还不满20岁的、热血沸腾...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9E339FC37BA33EF6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1310819008:0":{"text":"그 당시 카민스키 가문은 대가족이었는데, 어쩌면 화이트마운틴에 아직 그의 후손이 남아있을지도 몰라.","source_cn":"卡明斯基家当年是个大家族，或许现在白山还有他们的后裔。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x932BCC333D0636A3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1310819009:0":{"text":"음... 이 일이 끝난 후에 그들을 찾아가서 이 부적을 돌려주면 되겠네요.","source_cn":"嗯……也许这件事结束以后，可以去找找，将这个护身符还给他们。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4A2FE9E69C161A5E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:瓦丽卡":{"text":"발리카","source":"瓦丽卡","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":11,"localized_text_count":10,"speaker_count":3}}